# Tool history unavailable

<%= if @invalid_cursor? do %>
That continuation is not valid for this tool. Start again at [<%= plain(@name) %> on <%= plain(site_name(@site)) %>](<%= tool_path(@site, @name) %>).
<% else %>
The history of <%= code(@name) %> on <%= plain(site_name(@site)) %> could not be read just now. Try again in a moment.
<% end %>

<%= trailer() %>
